    <briefdescription>
<para>Windows dbgeng.dll explicit loader via LoadLibrary + GetProcAddress. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Loads the sidecar dbgeng.dll from the extraction directory and resolves the DebugCreate export. All other debug interfaces (IDebugControl, IDebugSymbols, etc.) are obtained via COM QueryInterface from the root IDebugClient5 pointer. </para>
